  "notable_quotes": [
    "Using different pillars can tune framework dimensionality and open-channel size from 1D to 3D because pillar length is closely related to pore size.",
    "Very flexible long-chain fatty dicarboxylates had rarely been used previously as pillars for assembling 3D pillared-layer MOFs.",
    "Flexible pillars are proposed to enable dynamic porous MOFs that can shrink and expand, and functional pillars can add hydrophilicity, H-bonding, or open metal sites."
